Yes, but it works only on stupid assholes. Smart ones will back down when
faced with dangerous people, and continue to be assholes when they know they can
get away with it. They may well get away with it for a long time. In societies
where the custom of duelling is designed to defend your honour, it carries
with it the implicit assumption that weak inoffensive people are less 
honourable, or more likely to accept attacks on their honour.

> > 	People who are in favour of the custom of dueling tend to be those who
